  "description_text": "Be the first to live in the newly transformed 1137 Park Ave, a truly exceptional Uptown Hoboken residence where historic brownstone elegance meets modern luxury. Ideally situated on one of the neighborhood's most coveted tree-lined blocks, this extraordinary townhome has undergone a massive down-to-the-studs renovation, thoughtfully reimagined with timeless design, superior craftsmanship, and the finest modern finishes.Featuring approximately 1,000 square feet of additional living space and a fully restored historic-inspired exterior, this home seamlessly blends classic architectural character with contemporary luxury. The residence offers four generously sized bedrooms, three full bathrooms one is a double shower and one powder room, along with soaring ceiling heights including approximately 9-foot ceilings on the garden level and 10-foot ceilings on the parlor, second, and third floors. Throughout the home, genuine white oak hardwood flooring creates a warm and sophisticated foundation, complemented by custom millwork, solid-core doors, modern architectural details, and designer finishes.Comfort and efficiency are enhanced by a two-zone central air and heating system, ensuring exceptional climate control throughout all levels of the residence.The spacious living room is designed for both elegant entertaining and everyday comfort, featuring seamless indoor-outdoor living with beautiful sliding glass doors that open directly to your private outdoor oasis. The expansive backyard retreat offers a rare 100-foot-deep lot, custom stonework, a bluestone paver patio, a built-in outdoor kitchen, and beautifully designed spaces for dining, relaxing, and entertaining.Extending the living experience outdoors, the private rooftop terrace offers a spectacular retreat above the city with iconic views of the Empire State Building and One World Trade Center. This exceptional space provides the perfect backdrop for entertaining, relaxing, and enjoying the beauty of the Manhattan skyline.The heart of the home is a spectacular designer chef's kitchen, crafted for both everyday living and exceptional entertaining. The kitchen features a dramatic 6-foot natural Calacatta Violetta Monet marble island, natural Calacatta Eternro Bianca marble backsplash, custom rift-cut oak slim shaker cabinetry, a large walk-in pantry, and a dedicated coffee bar. Top-of-the-line appliances include a Sub-Zero refrigerator, Wolf professional range with custom chef's hood, Wolf microwave, Miele dishwasher, and Sub-Zero wine refrigerator, complemented by a Kohler faucet and elegant Murano glass lighting. Perfectly positioned for the ultimate Hoboken lifestyle, this residence is just minutes from the Uptown FerryTerminal and offers NYC bus transportation at your doorstep, making commuting effortless. Rentable parking is conveniently located nearby",
